msgid "Free"
msgstr "Saor"

#: ../data/local.scope.in.in.h:1
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "Físeáin"

#: ../data/local.scope.in.in.h:2
msgid ""
"This is an Ubuntu search plugin that enables local videos to be searched and "
"displayed in the Dash underneath the Video header. If you do not wish to "
"search this content source, you can disable this search plugin."
msgstr ""
"Is breiseán cuardaigh Ubuntu é seo a chumasaíonn cuardach agus léiriú ar an "
"Dash d'fhíseáin áitiúla faoin aicme Video. Mura mian leat an foinse ábhair "
"seo a chuardach, is féidir an breiseán cuardaigh seo a chuardach."

#: ../data/remote.scope.in.in.h:1
msgid "Remote videos"
msgstr "Físeáin seachtracha"

#: ../data/remote.scope.in.in.h:2
msgid ""
"This is an Ubuntu search plugin that enables information from various video "
"providers to be searched and displayed in the Dash underneath the Video "
"header. If you do not wish to search these content sources, you can disable "
"this search plugin."
msgstr ""
"Is breiseán cuardaigh Ubuntu é seo a chumasaíonn eolas ó sholaithritheoirí "
"físeáin a chuardach agus a léiriú ar an Dash  faoin aicme Video. Mura mian "
"leat an foinse ábhair seo a chuardach, is féidir an breiseán cuardaigh seo a "
"chuardach."
